  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The block will just start sliding when the angle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></math>&nbsp;made by the inclined plane with the horizontal will be equal to the angle of repose.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mi>repose</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>tan&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
